{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "kokoro",
  "chunk_id": "kokoro-chunk-0091",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00522",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“如果我的生命是认真的，那么我刚才说的也是认真的。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If my life is in earnest, then what I just said was in earnest too.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00523",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "我的声音颤抖了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "My voice trembled.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00524",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“好吧！”先生说，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Very well!\" Sensei said,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00524",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "“我告诉你吧，把我的过去，毫无保留地都告诉给你。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"I will tell you, then. I will tell you all of my past, without holding anything back.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00524",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "不过……不，那没关系。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But... no, never mind.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00524",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "但是，我的过去也许对你没有多大的好处，不听或许更好。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But my past may not be of much use to you; perhaps it would be better not to hear it.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00524",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "而且——现在还不能说，你等着吧，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "And besides, I cannot tell you now. Please wait,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00524",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "不到适当的时候，我是不会告诉你的。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I will not tell you until the proper time comes.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00525",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "我回到住处后，依然感到某种压迫感。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After I returned to my lodging, I still felt a certain pressure weighing on me.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
